# Full CityGML 2.0 + Energy ADE 3.0 schema set, codelists and spec text: local reference only.
# The subset the XSD gate needs stays tracked in citygml2idf/validation_file/CityGml_ADE_SChema/.
/citygml2idf/CityGml_ADE_SChema/

# Docs / notes kept local only, never pushed
*.md

# Local-only runner + template data (EnergyPlus/FMU software is not in the repo).
